---
/**
 * EditorialPolicy.astro — Small widget to highlight editorial independence.
 */
---

<div class="brutal-card p-4 border-[var(--color-border)] bg-white mt-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-route-safe)]"></span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Editorial Independence</h4>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      Formation.Legal operates on a strict editorial policy. Providers cannot pay to alter our reviews, ratings, or route recommendations. Our primary allegiance is to the founder's operational success.
    </p>
    <a href="/editorial-policy" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-action)] hover:text-[var(--color-action-hover)] mt-1">Read the full policy →</a>
  </div>
</div>
